WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.370
In 1940, Coventry Cathedral was
bombed, leaving a ruined shell.

2
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.850
Today, that cathedral works
with partners worldwide,

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.660
including in Germany.

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.380
Elsewhere, Christians face prison,
violent attacks and burned churches,

5
00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.100
because of their faith.

6
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.710
So why would Christians pray for
people who burn their churches,

7
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.300
and work with churches they disagree with?

8
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:28.080
In this mission, you'll see how divided
churches formed the World Council of Churches

9
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.830
in 1948.

10
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.580
Then you'll trace
persecution, from Stephen,

11
00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:35.800
the first Christian martyr,
to Christians today.

12
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.560
Your mission: find out why Christians
pray for their persecutors and work with

13
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:42.190
churches they disagree with.
